{"id":"46462c2e30b7813d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-inseparable-creative.md","title":"有效不可分对的每一列都是创造集","display":"thm-effective-inseparable-creative — 有效不可分对的每一列都是创造集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-inseparable-creative","aliases":["20-thm-effective-inseparable-creative"],"display":"thm-effective-inseparable-creative — 有效不可分对的每一列都是创造集","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.4.17(iii)","source_printed_pages":[42],"source_pdf_pages":[78],"depends_on":["[[20-df-effective-inseparable]]","[[20-df-creative]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-inseparable-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-inseparable-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-inseparable-creative — 有效不可分对的每一列都是创造集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.4.17(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>42</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>78</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50c256093c2a445f\" href=\"?note=50c256093c2a445f\" title=\"20-df-effective-inseparable\">20-df-effective-inseparable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A,B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50c256093c2a445f\" href=\"?note=50c256093c2a445f\" title=\"20-df-effective-inseparable\">20-df-effective-inseparable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}creative}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Creative}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Creative}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}creative}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Creative}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Creative}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取该对的生产函数 p。给 W_e⊆Ā，统一取得 A 与 B∪W_e 的索引；它们是不交 c.e. 超集，所以 p 输出两者之外的元素，尤其位于 Ā\\W_e。这是 Ā 的生产函数。交换 A、B 同理。两列的 c.e. 性来自有效不可分定义，故均创造。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.4.17(iii)；印刷页 42；PDF 第 78 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-effective-inseparable","status":"resolved","id":"50c256093c2a445f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-inseparable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-creative","status":"resolved","id":"f98c8cce12228b4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-creative]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-effective-inseparable","status":"resolved","id":"50c256093c2a445f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-df-creative]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-creative","status":"resolved","id":"f98c8cce12228b4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-df-creative]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-df-creative]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{EffInseparable}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}creative}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Creative}(A)\\land\\operatorname{Creative}(B).","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["50c256093c2a445f","f98c8cce12228b4a","8ba6597a854c206f"]}